<item name='HFText'><text>Yes</text></item>
<item name='HelpECategories'><text>1. User Guide</text></item>
<item name='HelpESubCat'><text>Placing An Order</text></item>
<item name='HelpFCategories'><text>1. Guide d'utilisation</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubCat'><text>Commander</text></item>
<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>1</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>1</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='1in'/>
<par def='1'>Staff have the following responsibilities when placing orders:</par>
<par def='1'/>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1.2500in' list='number'/>
<par def='2'>Get approval from the Principal Investigator (PI) on the project for the order.</par>
<par def='2'>Get a quote or pricing from the company.</par>
<par def='2'>Place the order in the Order Tracking database (<run><font color='blue'/>See "Creating a New Order"</run>).</par>
<par def='2'>Get the cardholder's signature and card number/expiry date.  Please print the card and expiry info legibly.</par>
<par def='2'>Fax the order to the company.</par>
<par def='2'>Send the signed order and fax confirmation sheet to the Section Admin person (<run
><font color='blue'/>For items 4, 5 and 6, please see "What to do after the Order Number has been Assigned"</run>).</par>
<par def='2'>When the order arrives, verify that is complete or not complete.</par>
<par def='2'>Send the Packing Slip to the Section Admin person with your initials, date and "Verified Complete" or "Incomplete"  on the slip.</par>
<pardef id='3' leftmargin='1.2500in' spaceafter='1.5' list='number'/>
<par def='3'>If incomplete, follow up with the company as to when the balance of the order will arrive (<run
><font color='blue'/>For items 7, 8 and 9, please see "After the order has arrived"</run>).</par>
<par def='1'/>
<par def='1'/>
